  fishName: Magma Crab
  description: Scientists were baffled by the Magma Crab's body when it was first
    sighted. However, they soon learned the volcano on it's back is only cosmetic-
    a form of camoflage developed to blend in with the rough terrain of Firax.\n\nChef's
    Notes:\nThe body isn't any nicer than its distant cousin on Boreala, but the
    fake "lava" on it's back- some sort of gelatin- makes for a lovely thickener,
    and its shell can be powdered and used as a spice.
